  <rules>
    <rule name="Instinctual Adaptations" id="a5f5-5c4f-2219-c5cb" hidden="false">
      <description>Each round, during the Prep Phase (step 5), choose one of the following effects for the round.
- All your non-infantry Fighters improve their Defense Rank by 1. Decrease your PEP by 2.
- All your non-infantry Fighters gain the Fast Claim ability. All of your non-infantry Fighters gain the Conspicuous ability.
- All your Fighters gain the Evasive Maneuvers ability. Reduce your Charge keywords by 1 (minimum 0).
- All your Fighters gain Repair 1.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Innate Vigor" id="b2a7-f770-79b5-b331" hidden="false">
      <description>When you spend your last energy, roll a d10. Gain energy equal to the result (once per round).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Frenzy" id="8f76-2e92-90c9-5af5" hidden="false">
      <description>When a friendly fighter destroys an enemy fighter, you may spend an energy to remove an activation marker from that friendly fighter.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
